        "content": "<report>\nHP MOB daily 10/2/26\nMarcus R.\n\nall crews 7-3:30 (8 hrs) unless noted\nwx: clear, hi 79 lo 65\n\nmanpower:\nbayline labor 3 guys\nkeystone - 12 (10 hrs)\nelectricians 9 guys\nmech - 5\nclearwater - 3\nredline fp 3 guys\nsummit roofers x3\nglaziers x5\ngravel & grade x3\n\ndone today:\n- mech: hung branch duct and flex to diffusers L2 east\n- plumb: ran domestic water branches L2 west\n- site: prepped subgrade for curb and gutter East parking lot\n- sprinkler: dropped sprinkler heads to ceiling height L3 east\n\nissues:\n- none\nnear miss: ceiling grid bundle slid off scissor lift deck on l1, no injury\nvisitors: Lena Park (Harbor Health, owner's rep)\n</report>\n\nExtract this report with record_daily_report."
